<title>USA: Z-Seven fund to make distribution.</title>
<headline>Z-Seven fund to make distribution.</headline>
<dateline>MESA, Ariz 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Z-Seven Fund Inc said shareholders of record as of December 20, 1996, will receive a distribution of $2.80 per share for estimated capital gains.</p>
<p>The distribution is to be paid on December 31, 1996.  In addition, Z-Seven will pay a remainder distribution in 1997, if necessary, so that 100 percent of the 1996 net investment income and capital gains are distributed.</p>
<p>Z-Seven's new Distribution Reinvestment Program will be in effect for the 1996 distributions.</p>
<p>Enrollment must be completed by December 20, 1996.</p>
</text>
